{"version":1,"herramienta":"whisperx medium + wav2vec2 es (letras)","audio":"pleura.m4a","duracion":35.753,"texto":"La pleura es una membrana serosa formada histológicamente por una capa de mesotelio epitelioplano simple, apoyada sobre una capa subyacente de tejido conjuntivo, rico en fibras elásticas, fibras de colagena y vasos linfáticos superficiales. Se organiza estructuralmente en dos capas continuas, la hoja visceral que cubre la superficie exterior del pulmón, y la baja parietal que tapiza la cavidad torácica, el diafragma y el mediastina. Entre ambas capas se delimita la cavidad pleural, la cual alberga líquido pleural secretado por las células mesoateliales para lubricar y facilitar el deslizamiento de los pulmones durante la ventilación.","cues":[[0.0,"X"],[0.837,"H"],[0.917,"A"],[0.977,"C"],[1.097,"F"],[1.157,"D"],[1.317,"X"],[1.817,"B"],[1.998,"F"],[2.058,"D"],[2.258,"C"],[2.358,"A"],[2.418,"D"],[2.758,"B"],[2.818,"C"],[2.878,"E"],[2.938,"B"],[3.038,"D"],[3.158,"E"],[3.218,"B"],[3.278,"D"],[3.478,"B"],[3.618,"E"],[3.798,"B"],[3.858,"C"],[3.938,"B"],[3.998,"D"],[4.078,"C"],[4.158,"B"],[4.238,"C"],[4.398,"E"],[4.458,"B"],[4.659,"D"],[5.039,"C"],[5.239,"B"],[5.319,"E"],[5.399,"B"],[5.459,"C"],[5.619,"E"],[5.679,"C"],[5.859,"A"],[5.919,"C"],[6.199,"E"],[6.259,"A"],[6.339,"D"],[6.459,"E"],[6.579,"C"],[6.679,"A"],[6.739,"C"],[6.859,"X"],[7.039,"D"],[7.119,"A"],[7.179,"E"],[7.239,"C"],[7.319,"D"],[7.4,"B"],[7.46,"D"],[7.54,"E"],[7.62,"B"],[7.68,"C"],[7.76,"B"],[7.82,"D"],[8.18,"F"],[8.32,"A"],[8.4,"D"],[8.54,"B"],[8.76,"C"],[9.12,"B"],[9.18,"C"],[9.24,"E"],[9.42,"B"],[9.92,"C"],[10.0,"E"],[10.14,"X"],[10.561,"C"],[10.721,"E"],[10.881,"B"],[11.101,"G"],[11.201,"A"],[11.301,"D"],[11.381,"B"],[11.461,"C"],[11.541,"D"],[11.641,"B"],[11.721,"C"],[11.781,"D"],[11.861,"B"],[11.941,"A"],[12.061,"D"],[12.141,"B"],[12.241,"C"],[12.301,"E"],[12.421,"D"],[12.541,"C"],[12.621,"B"],[12.681,"D"],[12.801,"C"],[12.902,"D"],[13.022,"B"],[13.182,"C"],[13.262,"B"],[13.322,"D"],[13